## Hardware Pinout Reference
- Node A (ESP32-CAM):
  - Flash LED: GPIO 4
  - SD_MMC: GPIO 2, 14, 15, 13 (1-bit mode)
  - Shroud: 8 cm cylinder with acrylic diffuser
  - SoftAP: SSID "KRISHI-DRISHTI" -> 192.168.4.1
- Node B (ESP32 DevKit V1):
  - OLED SSD1306: SDA GPIO 21, SCL GPIO 22
  - DHT11 Sensor: DATA GPIO 18
  - Button SCAN: GPIO 27 (Active LOW)
  - Button NEXT: GPIO 26 (Active LOW)
- Node C (Edge AI):
  - Model: MobileNetV3 Float16/INT8 (2.01 MB), input [1, 128, 128, 3]
  - Uncertainty Gates: Shannon Entropy H > 1.45, Margin < 0.12, Foliar < 0.12, Dark > 0.45
  - Microclimate Gate: Late Blight sprays suppressed when RH < 85%

